==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|tooth|less|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Having no [[teeth]].
#: ''a '''toothless''' old man''
# {{context|figuratively|lang=en}} [[weak|Weak]], having no capability of enforcing something.
#: ''The treaty was '''toothless''' in combatting climate change.''

====Synonyms====
* [[edentulous]]

====Related terms====
* [[toothy]]
* [[voice of the toothless one]]

